              "value": "(fire, manipulate)\n\nFrequency: 1/day\n\nGurglegut drinks the contents of his jug of rice wine (consuming one of the gulps contained in his jug), then spews it out across the flaming tip of a bolt in his crossbow, filling a 20-foot-cone with a blast of fire that inflicts 10d8 fire damage (32 basic Reflex save) to all creatures in the area."
